# {{PLUGIN_NAME}} — opencode installation

{{PLUGIN_NAME}} is loaded as a local opencode plugin from `.opencode/plugins/`.

## Install

1. Copy this plugin directory into your project (opencode picks up
   `.opencode/plugins/` automatically).
2. Restart opencode so it rescans the plugin and skill directories.

## Skill discovery

Skills live in **one source**: the plugin-root `skills/` directory. The
bootstrap plugin (`.opencode/plugins/{{PLUGIN_PREFIX}}-bootstrap.ts`) registers that
directory as an opencode skill source at runtime via its `config` hook —
superpowers-style self-registration. Skill discovery is lazy, so paths
registered during plugin load are visible to the skill tool.

## Use

Ask the agent to run one of this plugin's skills (see `skills/`).
